### =====================================================================
### Collectiverse - llamadas REST de los 2 procesos (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Los endpoints de ambos procesos son PÚBLICOS (no requieren login).
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:8080

### ---------- PRE-REQUISITO: categoría y colección (requieren login) ----------
### Registra un usuario y úsalo con Basic Auth (usuario:clave en base64)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin1", "password": "secreto123" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/category
Authorization: Basic admin1:secreto123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Manga", "description": "Tomos de manga" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/collection
Authorization: Basic admin1:secreto123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idCategory": 1, "name": "Dragon Ball", "description": "Colección Dragon Ball" }


### =====================================================================
### PROCESO 2: Registrar y consultar un producto (cabecera Product, detalle ProductImage)
### =====================================================================

### POST /api/products  -> 201 (éxito)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "collectionId": 1,
  "name": "Dragon Ball Tomo 1",
  "stock": 10,
  "price": 49.90,
  "createdBy": "admin1",
  "images": [
    { "url": "https://img.test/a.jpg", "order": 1 },
    { "url": "https://img.test/b.jpg", "order": 2 }
  ]
}

### POST /api/products -> 404 (categoría inexistente)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 9999, "name": "Tomo X", "stock": 1, "price": 10, "createdBy": "admin1" }

### POST /api/products -> 400 (stock negativo)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": 1, "name": "Tomo X", "stock": -1, "price": 10, "createdBy": "admin1" }

### GET /api/products/{id} -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### GET /api/products/{id} -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/products/9999

### GET search por categoría -> 200 (Query 1: findActiveByCategoryWithDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?categoryId=1

### GET search por término -> 200 (Query 2: searchActiveWithDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?term=dragon

### GET search sin filtro -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/products/search


### =====================================================================
### PROCESO 1: Registrar y consultar una publicación (cabecera Publication, detalle PublicationExchange)
### =====================================================================

### POST /api/publications VENTA -> 201 (éxito)
POST {{host}}/api/publications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coleccionista",
  "productId": 1,
  "title": "Vendo Dragon Ball Tomo 1",
  "description": "En buen estado",
  "type": "VENTA",
  "state": "ACTIVA",
  "createdBy": "coleccionista"
}

### POST /api/publications INTERCAMBIO con detalle -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/publications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "coleccionista",
  "productId": 1,
  "title": "Cambio Tomo 1 por Tomo 2",
  "description": "Solo intercambio",
  "type": "INTERCAMBIO",
  "state": "ACTIVA",
  "createdBy": "coleccionista",
  "exchanges": [
    { "requestedName": "Dragon Ball Tomo 2", "description": "Cualquier edición", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### POST /api/publications -> 404 (producto inexistente)
POST {{host}}/api/publications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "coleccionista", "productId": 9999, "title": "X", "type": "VENTA", "state": "ACTIVA", "createdBy": "coleccionista" }

### POST /api/publications -> 400 (INTERCAMBIO sin detalle)
POST {{host}}/api/publications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "coleccionista", "productId": 1, "title": "X", "type": "INTERCAMBIO", "state": "ACTIVA", "createdBy": "coleccionista" }

### GET /api/publications/{id} -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/publications/1

### GET /api/publications/{id} -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/publications/9999

### GET search por username -> 200 (Query 1: findActiveByUsernameWithDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/publications/search?username=coleccionista

### GET search sin username -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/publications/search

### GET por tipo -> 200 (Query 2: findActiveByTypeWithDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/publications/by-type?type=INTERCAMBIO

### GET por tipo inválido -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/publications/by-type?type=REGALO
